{"manifestVersion":2,"arc":{"id":"brightbell-bloom","title":"The Brightbell Bloom","premise":"A guild festival road of ringing flowers, warmglass orchards, and highland kite towers is losing its rhythm to a strange storm signal. Two Adventurers follow the bells uphill, helping cheerful townsfolk along the way before the weather turns dangerous at the summit.","progression":{"metric":"dungeon_clears","target":3}},"lore":[{"id":"brightbell-road","title":"The Brightbell Road","summary":"Flower-bells along the guild road ring when friendly travelers pass.","body":"Bellbloom's roadside flowers were planted by generations of couriers. Their tiny cups ring in layered notes when footsteps shake the soil, turning an ordinary trade route into an accidental traveling song.","tags":["brightbell-bloom","location","guild-road"]},{"id":"storm-signal","title":"The Wrong Note","summary":"A new note in the hills is making creatures unusually restless.","body":"Kitewatch signalers first blamed the weather, but the same sharp tone now arrives even under clear skies. Animals flee it, festival bells answer it, and the old summit bell has begun ringing back on its own.","tags":["brightbell-bloom","mystery","storm"]},{"id":"emberglass-gardens","title":"Emberglass Gardens","summary":"Warm crystal fruit keeps the orchard bright after sunset.","body":"The Emberglass Orchard grows translucent fruit that stores a little daytime warmth. Cooks prize the peels for tea, while smiths reuse fallen shells as harmless lantern glass and bright decorative fittings.","tags":["brightbell-bloom","location","craft"]},{"id":"kitewatch-promise","title":"The Kitewatch Promise","summary":"Kitewatch keeps one signal flying for every traveler still on the road.","body":"The highland town never lowers its last kite before every expected traveler arrives. The custom began as practical weather signaling and became a quiet promise that no delayed guild member is written off as lost.","tags":["brightbell-bloom","town","tradition"]},{"id":"bellkeeper-note","title":"Bellkeeper's Note","summary":"An old maintenance note hints that the summit bell was built as a duet.","body":"The oldest ledger describes two tuned plates inside the summit bell: one to call across the valley and one to answer. The second plate has been silent for years, leaving the first to carry every storm warning alone.","tags":["brightbell-bloom","history","summit"]}],"enemies":[{"id":"bouncebud-slime","name":"Bouncebud Slime","baseHp":8,"retaliation":1,"abilities":["basic_retaliation"],"visualAssetId":"mob.green-slime.v1"},{"id":"ribbon-boar","name":"Ribbon Boar","baseHp":11,"retaliation":2,"abilities":["heavy_pressure"],"visualAssetId":"mob.brown-boar.v1"},{"id":"bellcap-mushroom","name":"Bellcap Mushroom","baseHp":9,"retaliation":1,"abilities":["self_mend"],"resistances":{"poison":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"mob.red-mushroom.v1"},{"id":"meadow-breeze","name":"Meadow Breeze","baseHp":10,"retaliation":1,"abilities":["ally_hunter"],"resistances":{"ice":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"mob.wind-elemental.v1"},{"id":"emberwing-hornet","name":"Emberwing Hornet","baseHp":16,"retaliation":3,"abilities":["ally_hunter"],"resistances":{"fire":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"mob.giant-hornet.v1"},{"id":"cinder-harpy","name":"Cinder Harpy","baseHp":18,"retaliation":3,"abilities":["heavy_pressure"],"resistances":{"fire":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"mob.crimson-harpy.v1"},{"id":"orchard-lancer","name":"Orchard Lancer","baseHp":20,"retaliation":3,"abilities":["heavy_pressure","self_mend"],"visualAssetId":"mob.spear-lizardfolk.v1"},{"id":"lantern-elemental","name":"Lantern Elemental","baseHp":17,"retaliation":3,"abilities":["self_mend"],"resistances":{"fire":"immune","ice":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"mob.fire-elemental.v1"},{"id":"gale-wolf","name":"Gale Wolf","baseHp":24,"retaliation":4,"abilities":["heavy_pressure"],"resistances":{"ice":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"mob.dire-wolf.v1"},{"id":"cloud-sentinel","name":"Cloud Sentinel","baseHp":28,"retaliation":4,"abilities":["heavy_pressure","self_mend"],"resistances":{"psychic":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"mob.stone-sentinel.v1"},{"id":"starhorn-spirit","name":"Starhorn Spirit","baseHp":23,"retaliation":4,"abilities":["ally_hunter"],"resistances":{"psychic":"high-resistant"},"visualAssetId":"mob.antler-spirit.v1"},{"id":"moon-lantern-wraith","name":"Moon-Lantern Wraith","baseHp":25,"retaliation":4,"abilities":["ally_hunter","self_mend"],"resistances":{"poison":"immune"},"visualAssetId":"mob.lantern-wraith.v1"}],"bosses":[{"id":"parade-golem","name":"Parade Golem","baseHp":34,"retaliation":4,"abilities":["heavy_pressure","self_mend"],"resistances":{"poison":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"boss.rune-golem.v1"},{"id":"ashplume-matron","name":"Ashplume Matron","baseHp":62,"retaliation":7,"abilities":["ally_hunter","heavy_pressure"],"resistances":{"fire":"high-resistant","ice":"resistant"},"visualAssetId":"boss.storm-griffin.v1"},{"id":"skybell-griffin","name":"Skybell Griffin","baseHp":92,"retaliation":9,"abilities":["ally_hunter","heavy_pressure","self_mend"],"resistances":{"psychic":"resistant","ice":"high-resistant"},"visualAssetId":"boss.radiant-angel.v1"}],"dungeons":[{"id":"brightbell-trial","name":"Brightbell Parade Trial","recommendedPlayers":2,"encounters":["bouncebud-slime","ribbon-boar","meadow-breeze"],"bossId":"parade-golem","rewardPoolId":"meadow-gear"},{"id":"emberglass-procession","name":"Emberglass Procession","recommendedPlayers":2,"encounters":["emberwing-hornet","cinder-harpy","orchard-lancer","lantern-elemental"],"bossId":"ashplume-matron","rewardPoolId":"ember-gear"},{"id":"kitewind-summit","name":"Kitewind Summit","recommendedPlayers":2,"encounters":["gale-wolf","cloud-sentinel","starhorn-spirit","moon-lantern-wraith"],"bossId":"skybell-griffin","rewardPoolId":"sky-gear"}],"itemPools":[{"id":"meadow-gear","items":[{"id":"meadow-sabre","namePattern":"Meadow Sabre of {suffix}","slot":"weapon","rarity":"common","attackBonus"